[19.332261, "o", "\r\n== CARD ==\r\n"]
[19.334921, "o", "held\r\n  JSON array of 32-character lowercase hex strings. Each held id is the sha256 digest of the slip, truncated to 16 bytes, lowercase hex.\r\n\r\nnote\r\n  Use the token ok when kind is live.\r\n  Use the token gap when kind is void.\r\n\r\nkind\r\n  live means the wake pass exited 0.\r\n  void means the wake pass exited non-zero.\r\n\r\nA pin row is 48 bytes starting with ASCII PN01. Bytes after the magic are offset, length, checksum, then a 16-byte id.\r\n"]
